{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "13981e9be064c6a6be267d5706bacb24e7c33f576f58ce2e6e49448ab16ea34a", "ja": "月虹 ～Moonbow～", "zh": "月虹 ～Moonbow～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "554211eef842cb8d19f4a50917db46811016e9a065e0e9ba6ba7cec574f4751b", "ja": "風花と貴音の約束の日。雨のせいで、風花の\n撮影が長引いてしまったため、予定を変更し\n夜の公園でのピクニックに訪れた二人。風花\nは貴音を月になぞらえながら、孤独に震える\n貴音に優しく寄り添うのだった。", "zh": "这是风花和贵音约定的日子。因为下雨，风花的拍摄拖延了，两人便改变计划，来到夜晚的公园野餐。风花把贵音比作月亮，温柔地陪伴着因孤独而颤抖的贵音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ab9c5a10f9110fceb233cc0b9e195acd127c936f156f3ea4bee6a1096b5f4075", "ja": "（今日は風花オンリーでの撮影日。\nでも雨が降り出して、撮影が中断してしまった……）", "zh": "（今天是风花单独拍摄的日子。\n可是下起了雨，拍摄被迫中断了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "57dfb387a0972053ebdf34d6a5fc09f04596191901c14c87e1a7a00521aa5d81", "ja": "天気待ちで、ずいぶん経ちましたけど……。\n撮影、まだ再開しないんでしょうか……？", "zh": "等天气好转已经等了挺久了……\n拍摄还不能重新开始吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5dc9dec3662f2c51a706ef98649fd4293ed1306b7cc5c00148ac797870674ac2", "ja": "もう少し様子を見たいそうだ。今日は貴音とご飯を\n食べるって言ってたけど、時間は大丈夫か？", "zh": "好像还想再看看情况。虽然你之前说过今天要和贵音\n一起吃饭，时间上没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6c6c6ec76ecea65d1a992a29083846812070d80e3cd3d2848f2f57efea17258a", "ja": "それが……もう無理そうだからリスケしようって、\nさっきメッセージを送ったんですけど、貴音ちゃん……", "zh": "那个……好像已经不行了，所以我刚才发消息说改天再约，可是贵音她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1fc630a25ff30eddcd5b4812188fc3d30f0b572c5756550313e0243bb7dd5c7b", "ja": "「お待ちしています」って。", "zh": "说“我会等您的”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93", "ja": "そうか……。", "zh": "是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "60f98fea95d29758003b36f27c251717878159aebdd63c82450a44a7b869d5b3", "ja": "あ……風花、こちらです。", "zh": "啊……风花，在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d58c57d52821a0bfe4143c157be59b9576f90fa9fdcababd0583fec30b9a6328", "ja": "貴音ちゃん！　はぁ、はぁ……。\nごめんね、すっかり遅くなっちゃって。", "zh": "贵音！呼、呼……对不起，我不小心迟到了这么久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "fbd42520188542f284bbfcfa42b53148bc2209e772ebc1cef8435fafe4b4eafb", "ja": "いいえ、待ち人の訪れを楽しみに過ごす、\nよき時間でした。", "zh": "不，这是一段静候所等之人前来的，\n美好时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d57476859c404445e6857825a3bdf606195d90deb7430f48c84c2ad9c28127ae", "ja": "そ、そうなの？　ならよかったけど……。\nでも、もうお店はどこも閉まってる時間だね。", "zh": "这、这样吗？那就好……  \n不过现在这个时间，店家都已经关门了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8d242d7a8121af01523cc52f3b228eabe8d8cf89ec4e3e0297554e355925d125", "ja": "残念だけど、ご飯はまた今度かな？", "zh": "虽然有点遗憾，但吃饭只能下次再说了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "be080bdbf755dbdc6ae58fc5bff570981e5e62254a2422110e65c69d660d49af", "ja": "はい。店での食事は、ぜひまた日を改めて。\nですが今宵はこのまま、風花と行きたいところが。", "zh": "是的。店里的饭，改天一定要再去吃。\n不过今晚，我想就这样和风花去一个地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "1716006529c6d969c5789f2a8fb9e6bd028ae9b7312e2e59d5eeed2b0b0872a4", "ja": "まずは、夜のぴくにっくなど……いかがですか？", "zh": "首先，去夜间野餐……如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a99ca0ae7e26d698dfea0b6e70dc36d40d0f4003b8efd3dfdf836d87ce40530a", "ja": "はぁ、美味しかった～♪　ありがとう、貴音ちゃん。\n出来合いのお惣菜、あんなに買ってくれてたなんて。", "zh": "哈啊，好好吃～♪谢谢你，贵音。\n没想到你竟然买了这么多现成的熟食。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "eea0c1438966562fbef5c43d34158516635087e9cc821dcc92a39eb2efa03a81", "ja": "風花は夕食を食べる時間もないと思いましたので、\n少し多めに……。真、こんびにとは便利なものですね。", "zh": "我想着风花恐怕连吃晚饭的时间都没有，所以就稍微多买了一些……便利店还真是方便呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "94b46aa936712295659f1917f249107fbe1e285e49402a0a67767f3349c7e604", "ja": "それにしても、夜の公園でピクニックなんて初めて。\n貴音ちゃんは、よくしてるの？", "zh": "不过话说回来，我还是第一次在晚上的公园里野餐。贵音，你经常这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "64ce3a5e88cf2e1b7464eebb2858d8e6a091a9ce276dab1efc766a8aa4185d56", "ja": "いえ、このようなぴくにっくは私も初めてなのですが、\nこの公園には、よく立ち寄っています。", "zh": "不，这样的野餐我也是第一次，不过我经常来这个公园。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "d8f95e7ae189202c19d49b42b6b6c09b28108454024f23c43c290f0020985dd4", "ja": "ほら、あのように。\n月がよく見えるものですから。", "zh": "你看，就像那样。\n因为在这里能清楚地看到月亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eba802560e8d8125c6e227eb05e2b4401d521ea28105bd0602348023bf2bf573", "ja": "わぁ……！　本当だ、すっごくきれい……。", "zh": "哇……！真的呢，好漂亮啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "7f215947b70cd2a08b55ca2a269eb018392fc163b84c89c3d5ff85c1dcf7e4eb", "ja": "雨上がりの月は、とても美しいのです。\n特に今宵の月は格別かと……。", "zh": "雨后的月亮，格外美丽。\n尤其是今夜的月亮，更是非同寻常……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "31781e9ddb133fd49d6e0deb8594c18cc49a8adbc2be8cb20305aad94ccb2929", "ja": "うん……。なんだか月の周りが、\n虹みたいに光ってる……。", "zh": "嗯……总觉得月亮周围像彩虹一样在发光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "ae906ec51ac6e6d40cefefb6b5887a365075e0c81e1b4917d1f8fbe4f4781d51", "ja": "はい。月に虹と書いて月虹（げっこう）……夜の虹。\n見た者には幸運が訪れるとも言われています。", "zh": "是的。月虹，写作“月”和“虹”……也就是夜之虹。\n据说见到它的人会迎来幸运。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b17aad6ab249749064e2bb51147e4322f5c31304c4057ea50999475852455bbf", "ja": "そうなんだ……！　もしかして、あの月を私に見せる\nために、ずっと待っててくれたの？", "zh": "原来是这样……！难道说，你一直在等着，就是为了让我看到那轮月亮吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1025_008tak", "source_sha256": "b0bd87e46ec6c57f544c1d421679979abf20a6cc3f73a06963975a886698745b", "ja": "いえ、私はただ……\n風花と、あの月を眺めたかった。……それだけです。", "zh": "不，我只是……\n想和风花一起眺望那轮月亮……仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "97c8fb885b6aa6f2687c67114c1b0453b4c537c4cb5565089751a64ef2a1c959", "ja": "そっか……。\nふふっ、とってもうれしい。……ありがとう……。", "zh": "这样啊……\n呵呵，我真的特别开心。……谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "89edc6995ef74c5e15bac4842d844e817436047016b4717c2bdfaf34e1466cee", "ja": "なんだか……わかった気がする。\n月って貴音ちゃんに似てるんだね。", "zh": "总觉得……我好像明白了。\n月亮和贵音很像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "1af5f2b863b45eccf579d0f7a93023f63e2f5eb623b895cab3ce3d055f8a5892", "ja": "？　月が……私に、ですか？", "zh": "月亮……像我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0fe4a689026c95fad3c7915d975ef865123ada8f7aff8c589deb626cdf2a97a4", "ja": "うん。とっても綺麗で、静かにみんなを\n照らしてくれているところも……。", "zh": "嗯。不仅非常美丽，而且静静地\n照耀着大家这一点也是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "79706cfbce55251de50597d96251fef3d8cdcd536d730cab5dd20d9bda4306de", "ja": "気がついたらひとりでいるところも。\nでも、手を伸ばしても、届かない気がするところも……", "zh": "不知不觉间会独自一人待着这一点也是。\n不过，感觉就算伸出手，也触碰不到它，这一点也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1031_008tak", "source_sha256": "34d0c27466825d097436b5f0f7e753c2059d1394d3cd6c08109fea94b2da8e65", "ja": "あ。……それは……。", "zh": "啊……那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d87690605cdd1af0bd42cdb9b6a65a4c283b4f68c4eed1a8760bc77daf0e3118", "ja": "ふふっ、今日は大丈夫かな？\nちゃんと手が届きそう……。", "zh": "呵呵，今天应该没问题吧？\n好像能顺利够到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2658a35bec31207372f3495e331d3f8f9c37135f615c0d4040bd0fc96f77e49b", "ja": "貴音ちゃん。これからも、\nもし寂しくなったら、いつでも私に言ってね。", "zh": "贵音，以后要是觉得寂寞了，随时都可以告诉我哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b1eec3c35a86006446071411a6e2e1e158803b903a76578b317e8fe6b0f8a945", "ja": "私は……。\n私たちは、貴音ちゃんの仲間だから。……ね？", "zh": "我……因为我们是贵音的伙伴。……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1036_008tak", "source_sha256": "87b1d23bfa19d68935a5163ea1564f18bead61b73fe3badc09a032064da40d68", "ja": "どうして貴女は……\nそんなにも、やさしいのですか？", "zh": "你为什么会……  \n这么温柔呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1037_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1038_008tak", "source_sha256": "bfbe8a817bdd92ef73004d3aeebb781ee1776be12556712c31c2dd5e178680fc", "ja": "そんな貴女だから。そんな貴女たちだから、\n私は……怖いのです。", "zh": "正因为是这样的你。正因为是这样的你们，\n我才……感到害怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1039_008tak", "source_sha256": "2dafda58b3dd6ee9bb5265af65ff395539b2d9da28b3eebe1f972b9a88250e82", "ja": "いつかまた、失ってしまうのでは、と……。", "zh": "总觉得有朝一日，又会再次失去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9a437ef11d75b030af42bd3ae5824ed250014f036e3a3289fd66681d0417952d", "ja": "貴音ちゃん……。", "zh": "贵音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0dc92ae31c08895255a30e5d4fd3a29ccc0f4504a2534340345c571393951afc", "ja": "ねえ、貴音ちゃん。私は……どんなに大切な人でも、\nどんなにかけがえない人でも……。", "zh": "喂，贵音……我啊……无论是多么重要的人，\n无论是多么无可替代的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ee3157023420d78cd4d798183aef510295165b41c60d7e01825835e77e8ceac6", "ja": "いつかお別れする日は来ると思う。本当の意味で、\n私たちはずっと一緒にはいられないから。……でもね。", "zh": "总有一天离别之日会到来的。因为在真正意义上，\n我们是不可能永远在一起的。……可是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1043_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1d4d80929a95ffd427dd205b4e76b37d64003bee584a0aaca8d8c9b788646c80", "ja": "だからもっと大事にしたい。もっと一緒にいたいの。\nずっとはできなくても、今ならできるから。", "zh": "所以才更想珍惜这份感情。更想和你在一起。\n就算无法永远如此，但现在还做得到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "937116328f361155e70cdb1467e26258ff1c7d4cba3e287dd0070be5038ac8e7", "ja": "そしたらきっと、もっともっと大事になって、もっと\nもっと近づけると思うの。何も怖くなくなるくらい！", "zh": "这样一来，一定能变得更加、更加珍贵，也能更加、更加靠近。我觉得一定能靠近到连什么都不再害怕的程度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1045_008tak", "source_sha256": "654e885e2468519ad5cb55c1d7a1427eef4cf0b7d78fcffc5b2d85b1a86bbfe4", "ja": "怖く……なくなるくらい……。", "zh": "不再……感到害怕的程度……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1046_041fuk", "source_sha256": "08e038896e1890305b1441f62420c114912c07d3d585cc5b9dd1c2d122543036", "ja": "あっ……ごめんなさい！\n私、なんだかまた勝手なこと言ってるかも～！", "zh": "啊……对不起！\n我好像又在自说自话了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1047_008tak", "source_sha256": "edceb2d351b56138c9b7974e36ed6a3dc8bd634cefaf462b42d9183cca2b8b94", "ja": "いえ、とても心強いお言葉でした。\nそうですね。恐れていては、離れるばかり……。", "zh": "不，您说的话让我感到非常安心。\n是啊，一味害怕的话，只会离得越来越远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1048_008tak", "source_sha256": "92e66b931ce37243c84232f49aac174efe6ef7af18e624ccd53dafe1ce7dc990", "ja": "何やら……迷いが晴れた気がいたします。\n……風花は、大人ですね。", "zh": "总觉得……心中的迷惘好像消散了。\n……风花，你真是成熟呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1049_041fuk", "source_sha256": "01cfc5e99db9156450d57d67b6942fe9e2c5eb160a6478d9321426e658290b56", "ja": "ええっ、そうかな？　う～ん……。\nまぁ、ちょっとだけね♪", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？嗯……  \n不过，也就一点点啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1051_p", "source_sha256": "e1072a6e21c5714e2e785415cd6a91af247889dc0375107b4d513b2c816195f8", "ja": "（風花を送ったついでに、様子を見ていたけど。\n二人の絆がさらに強まったらしい……）", "zh": "（送风花回去的时候，顺便观察了一下情况。\n看来两人的羁绊又加深了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "47225b471286f42af3908f17bc9a0211dcaea73fd4cd7dcdd5a0e81b5aaf21fd", "ja": "（公園からも無事に出て来たし。\n月がきれいなうちに、こっちも帰るとするか！）", "zh": "（她们顺利从公园里出来了。\n趁月色还这么美，我也该回去了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
